    <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.15 }}>任务三：三张卡接成链</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>读法一</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column', position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34' }}>三张卡接成链（10 无为政治 ＋ 11 长老统治）</Text>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 26, marginLeft: 24, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>农业剩余有限</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#B4552D', marginLeft: 14 }}>↓ 所以</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>皇权不下县</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#B4552D', marginLeft: 14 }}>↓ 于是</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>无为而治</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#6B6B6B', marginTop: 22 }}>这两篇是同一种论证形态：从条件推出结果。所以用同一种读法。</Text>
  </Box>
  </Box>
